                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pele Jabezi wakakwiilila Leza wa-Israyeli, wakati, Ndakumbila kuti undilongezye ncobeni, akukomezya caabilo cangu canyika. Ijanza lyako libe ambebo, undivune kububi, kuti butandibisizyi. Nkabela Leza wakamucitila mbubonya mbwaakakumbila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
