              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bana ba-Sela mwana wa-Juda mbaaba: Eri wisi Leka, a-Laada wisi Maresa, anzubo zyaŋanda yabasikucita masani aatuba ku-Beti-Asibeya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
